---
import "../styles/styles.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cami Layé Okún – About</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Mrs+Sheppards&display=swap"rel="stylesheet"/>
  </head>

  <body class="page-about">
    <nav class="top-nav">
      <div class="nav-container">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Cami Layé Okún</a>

        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="/about" class="active">About</a></li>

          <li><a href="/tour">Tour</a></li>

          <li><a href="/playlist">Playlists</a></li>

        </ul>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="about-main">
      <section class="about-content">
        <div class="about-text">

          <p>
            <h1> A CUBAN DJ, <br> VYNIL SELECTOR <br> & RADIO HOST</h1>
            known for crafting warm journeys through Afro‑Cuban,
            Caribbean, and Latin American music.
          </p>

          <p>
           <br> A dedicated digger, she builds her sets from deeply researched
            records and under‑represented scenes, connecting Havana’s musical
            heritage with sounds from across the African diaspora and beyond.
           
            <p>Her selections often move effortlessly between spiritual jazz,
            tropical disco, raw percussion, and soulful dance‑floor cuts. </p>
          </p>

          <p>
            Beyond the club, Cami shares her musical world through her
            <a href="https://www.nts.live/shows/cami-laye-okun"target="_blank"rel="noreferrer">
              Insolar show on NTS Radio </a>
            , where she highlights overlooked artists, labels, and traditions
            while telling stories about the roots and routes of the records she
            plays.
          </p>

          <p>
            She has brought her all‑vinyl approach to venues and festivals
            around the world, appearing in clubs, listening bars, and cultural
            spaces that value deep and narrative‑driven sets.
          </p>
        </div>


        <aside class="about-artist-card">
          <img src="/artist-picture.jpg"
            alt="Portrait of DJ and selector Cami Layé Okún"
            class="artist-picture"/>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/camilayeokun/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">Instagram</a>

        <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/camilayeokun/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">Facebook</a>

        <a
          href="https://www.nts.live/shows/cami-laye-okun"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">NTS Radio</a>

        <a
          href="https://soundcloud.com/camila-garc-a-valent-n"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">SoundCloud</a>

      </div>

      <div>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Cami Layé Okún. All Rights Reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
